"Nyx" means the app of that name for iPhone, iPad, Apple Watch and Apple
Vision Pro, and everything in this repository: source code, the Darkness
Score method and its implementation, bundled data sets and curated place
lists, designs, shaders, artwork, the app icon, screenshots, text, and the
website content in docs/ (together, the "Work").

The Work is published so that people can read it and see how Nyx handles
data. Publication is not a grant of rights.

1. What you may do
